        <div class="notes" id="notes-7684972" data-guid="7684972"></div>
        <div id="questions-7684972" data-guid="7684972" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7684972_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">All taxes and penalties received by the Comptroller under this article shall be credited to and deposited in the general fund of the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

